From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Market Canopy <office@marketcanopy.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Load only the Market Canopy provider in the AI plugin

ADR 0525: the in-editor AI plugin uses Market Canopy as its only
provider. The provider's code is in the overlay
(providers/internal/marketcanopy.js); this list is what the plugin loads,
so the bundled third-party providers are no longer offered.
---
 .../ai/scripts/engine/providers/config.json    | 18 +-----------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sdkjs-plugins/content/ai/scripts/engine/providers/config.json b/sdkjs-plugins/content/ai/scripts/engine/providers/config.json
index 92da70b..4ce7b81 100644
--- a/sdkjs-plugins/content/ai/scripts/engine/providers/config.json
+++ b/sdkjs-plugins/content/ai/scripts/engine/providers/config.json
@@ -1,19 +1,3 @@
 [
-	"openai",
-	"google-gemini",
-	"anthropic",
-	"xAI",
-	"stabilityai",
-	"deepseek",
-	"mistral",
-	
-	"together.ai",
-	"groq",
-	"openrouter",
-
-	"ollama",
-	"lmstudio",
-	"gpt4all",
-
-	"zhipu"
+	"marketcanopy"
 ]
